  - partName: Anal region.l
    systemName: Regions of Human Body
    partType: Anatomical Landmark / Region
    description: A recognized anatomical landmark and topographical region of the
      human body (Anal region), serving as an important clinical, surgical, and anatomical
      reference point.
    function: Defines spatial boundaries, encloses neurovascular bundles, and provides
      anatomical landmarks for physical examination and surgical approaches.
    location: Situated in the human body of the human body. Left side (bilateral
      structure).
