  - partName: Anterior region of elbow.l
    systemName: Regions of Human Body
    partType: Anatomical Landmark / Region
    description: A recognized anatomical landmark and topographical region of the
      human body (Anterior region of elbow), serving as an important clinical, surgical,
      and anatomical reference point.
    function: Defines spatial boundaries, encloses neurovascular bundles, and provides
