    function: Provides mechanical stability, guides physiological articulation kinematics,
      and prevents excessive or abnormal joint displacement in the hip and femoral
      region.
    location: Spans across the articular capsule and bone margins of the hip and
      femoral region. Left side (bilateral structure).
    fmaId: 
    fmaPreferredName: 
